<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50653" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vertīgo</span></b> , ĭnis,
			f.
		verto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a turning</i> or <i>whirling round</i> (perh.
			not ante-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">assidua caeli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 70</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ponti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 11, 548</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 5, 13, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torti fili,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					6, 460</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rotarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Psych. 414</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">assiduā vertigine rotare aliquem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 40, 61, § 150</span></i>
			: quibus una Quiritem Vertigo facit, <i>a
			turn</i>, <i>twirl</i> of a slave in manumission,
				<i><span class="en">Pers.
				5, 76</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a whirling</i>
			
			<i>of the head</i>, <i>giddiness</i>,
				<i>dizziness</i>, <i>vertigo</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				44, 6, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 15, 57, § 161</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">20, 17, 73, §
				194</span></i>; <i><span class="en">25, 9, 70,
				§ 117</span></i>; 25, 11, 89, § 139 al.;
					<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7, 9</span></i>.—Of
			persons intoxicated, <i><span class="en">Juv. 6,
			304</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a revolution</i>,
				<i>change</i>, <i>alteration</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vertigine rerum Attoniti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc. 8,
					16</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
